    ["724-回到咖啡厅"] = "724-Return to the Cafe",
    ["800人战场"] = "800-Player Battlefield",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时虫宝藏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>“恶作剧之神”阿蒙藏有时之虫的宝藏散落在各处，触碰时之裂隙能唤出阿蒙的谜题。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找时虫宝藏</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【时虫宝藏】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【时虫宝藏】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 开启寻宝</>\n与时之裂隙互动，并完成与单片眼镜虚影的对话后，即可开启寻宝挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 收集宝藏</>\n根据指引寻找散落的宝箱，收集全部宝箱后即可开启最终宝箱，获得奖励。\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n<Assistant_Red>灵视</>可以帮助发现隐藏的宝箱，建议在寻找过程中使用哦~\n部分隐藏宝箱需要完成挑战后才能开启。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Worm of Time Treasure】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>The \"God of Mischief\" Amon has hidden treasures of Worms of Time scattered everywhere. Touching a Rift of Time can summon Amon's puzzles.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding the Worm of Time Treasure</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Worm of Time Treasure] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Worm of Time Treasure] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Starting the Treasure Hunt</>\nInteract with the Rift of Time and complete the conversation with the monocle phantom shadow to start the treasure hunt challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Collecting the Treasure</>\nFollow the guidance to find the scattered treasure chests; after collecting all of them, you can open the final treasure chest to receive your reward.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\n<Assistant_Red>spirit vision</> can help you discover hidden treasure chests; it is recommended to use it during your search~\nSome hidden treasure chests can only be opened after completing a challenge.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【知识所扮演的】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>是知识扮演了我，还是我扮演了知识？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(1144,1167)]|14462;16761;-1943;2;5200002;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>杂乱的书堆</>交互接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Acted by Knowledge】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Did Knowledge act as me, or did I act as Knowledge?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Advance to Sequence 7, go to {Location:[Tingen (1144, 1167)]|14462;16761;-1943;2;5200002;0}, and interact with the <Assistant_Red>Messy Pile of Books</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>战斗新手·一</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-成长\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>任意技能达到5级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Combat Novice · I</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Development\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Any Skill reaches Level 5",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>魅力轻礼服\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Charming Light Gown\nIn the Midsummer Night's Wonderland, it is not just the wings of fairies that glide across the sky, but also the fluttering hearts of poets.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>征服宣令</>\n1、战略服开放期间，每周日12:00-19:30开放宣战；\n2、宣战开放时，可向俱乐部神选积分排名与己方俱乐部差距在3及之内的俱乐部宣战；\n3、可战斗时间为周日20:00-20:25、20:30-20：55两场，宣战方宣战时可自由选择任一时间段；\n4、一个俱乐部可以同时被多俱乐部宣战，若被多个俱乐部宣战，各进攻方也互为敌对阵营；\n5、俱乐部可同时处于宣战他人和被他人宣战状态，也可以同时宣战多个俱乐部，可在征服宣令界面在各战斗俱乐部场景自由传送；\n6、战斗中，进攻方需占据上下两座征服之碑（任意进攻方即可，无需同一进攻方占据），方可打开战争之门，攻打征服旌旗；\n7、若征服旌旗被攻占，进攻方全员获胜，并掠夺防守方神选积分，夺得尾刀方将获得更多神选积分；\n8、若时间结束征服旌旗未被攻占，进攻方全员失败，将损失俱乐部神选积分，防守方获得神选积分。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Conquest Decree</>\n1. During the Strategic Server opening period, declarations of war are open every Sunday from 12:00 to 19:30;\n2. When declarations of war are open, you can declare war on Clubs whose God-Chosen point ranking is within 3 places of your own Club;\n3. Battle times are two sessions: Sunday 20:00-20:25 and 20:30-20:55. The declaring party can freely choose either time period when declaring war;\n4. A Club can be declared war upon by multiple Clubs simultaneously. If declared war upon by multiple Clubs, each attacking party is also a hostile faction to the others;\n5. A Club can be in a state of declaring war on others and being declared war upon by others simultaneously. It can also declare war on multiple Clubs at the same time and can freely teleport between various combat Club scenes in the Conquest Decree interface;\n6. During battle, the attacking party must occupy the two Conquest Monuments (any attacking party is fine, no need for the same attacking party to occupy both) to open the War Gate and attack the Banner of Conquest;\n7. If the Banner of Conquest is captured, all members of the attacking party win and plunder the God-Chosen points of the defending party. The party that lands the final blow will receive more God-Chosen points;\n8. If the Banner of Conquest is not captured when time runs out, all members of the attacking party lose, will lose Club God-Chosen points, and the defending party will gain God-Chosen points.",
