    ["成就-我要我觉得"] = "Achievement - I Want What I Think",
    ["我的上一出戏在王国大剧院公演时，就连国王陛下和诸位大臣都对我的台词赞不绝口，怎么会有人不喜欢呢？"] = "When my last play premiered at the Royal Theater, even His Majesty the King and the ministers praised my lines. How could anyone not like them?",
