    ["时代的浪潮正席卷廷根，骑上黑荆棘新员工的脚踏车，到处逛逛吧。"] = "The tide of the era is sweeping through Tingen; hop on the bicycle of a new Blackthorn employee and go for a ride.",
    ["曾经有些小插曲，不过这是我的私事。为了流浪王国的未来，外交大臣，我跟你一起去谈判。"] = "There were some small episodes, but this is my private matter. For the future of the Wandering Kingdom, Minister of Foreign Affairs, I will go negotiate with you.",
