    ["朗切尔"] = "Lanchel",
    ["期待这次你能带来全新的旋律。当然，作为回报，我的酬谢亦将通过回响之匣交付于你。"] = "I look forward to you bringing a brand new melody this time. Of course, in return, my reward will also be delivered to you through the Echo Box.",
