    ["本届乱斗中，<PVPHighlight>%s</>幻象投影的总得分最高，表现优异；<PVPHighlight>%s</>击败其他幻象投影最多，无人能敌！"] = "In this brawl, <PVPHighlight>%s</>'s phantom projection had the highest total score, performing excellently; <PVPHighlight>%s</> defeated the most other phantom projections, invincible!",
