    ["特伦索斯特黄铜书，一本由薄薄黄铜组成的书册。参与并完成副本、竞技、冒险挑战任务，即可获取对应的挑战积分和代币，领取和兑换丰富奖励与限定外观。黄铜书副本挑战需要在副本内与NPC交互对话开启挑战。"] = "Tudor Brass Book, a book made of thin brass sheets. Participate in and complete dungeon, competitive, and adventure challenge quests to obtain corresponding challenge points and tokens to claim and exchange for rich rewards and limited appearances. Brass Book dungeon challenges require interacting with NPCs within the dungeon to initiate the challenge.",
    ["玛丽阿姨就住我们隔壁！我看着他们长大的，现在我已经是大孩子，可以照顾他们啦。"] = "Aunt Mary lives right next door to us! I watched them grow up, and now I'm a big kid, so I can take care of them.",
    ["现在卤鹅王国暂时<P_Yellow>风调雨顺</>，今天还可以进行<P_Yellow>一</>项事务，你打算做什么？"] = "Currently, the Goose Kingdom is temporarily <P_Yellow>enjoying favorable weather</>. You can perform <P_Yellow>one</> task today. What do you intend to do?",
