    ["真是一场厄难，所幸你们获得了平安。"] = "What a disaster, fortunately, you all obtained safety.",
    ["睿见贤者"] = "Wise Sage",
    ["神父看到他上了去<P_Yellow>拉姆德古堡</>的火车，一个月才赚3镑的家伙，怎么舍得去度假胜地？！女神啊，他到底偷了我的什么啊？"] = "The priest saw him board the train to <P_Yellow>Lamud Castle</>. How could a guy who only earns 3 pounds a month afford to go to a vacation resort?! Oh Goddess, what on earth did he steal from me?",
    ["科迪·"] = "Cody ",
    ["秘偶技能高亮"] = "Marionette Skill highlight",
    ["穿着我的衣服，梳着我的头发，像我从来没有离开过。"] = "Wearing my clothes, combing my hair, as if I had never left.",
