    ["而且这里还闹过鬼！蒸汽在上，教会的人来看了之后就留下一盏煤油灯，也不知道有没有用。"] = "And this place is haunted! Steam above, the Church people came to look and left a kerosene lamp, but I don't know if it's useful.",
