    ["说的没错。"] = "Well said.",
    ["请输入动作名称"] = "Please enter the action name",
    ["调查的经过就是这样，我在海纳斯的梦中看到一个<P_Yellow>倒吊的、赤身裸体的男人</>，灵性的保护让我直接晕过去了。"] = "The investigation went like this: in Haines's dream, I saw a <P_Yellow>hanging, naked man</>. The protection of my spirituality caused me to faint immediately.",
