    ["这二者之间有什么关联？"] = "What is the connection between the two?",
    ["这里是属于心灵、精神与意识的世界，个人意识如同岛屿漂浮在集体潜意识大海上，对于岛屿的影响也将投射到现实世界。在未知因素的作用下，集体潜意识大海的秩序崩塌，疯狂与混乱笼罩了越来越多的心灵岛屿。为了防止现实世界出现不可预知的危险，你决定接下奥黛丽的委托，前往风暴中心——那座巨龙盘旋的火山之上，调查与清除污染的根源。"] = "This is a world of mind, spirit, and consciousness. Individual consciousness floats like an island on the sea of collective subconsciousness, and influences on the island will also be projected into the real world. Under the influence of unknown factors, the order of the sea of collective subconsciousness has collapsed, and madness and chaos have shrouded more and more islands of the mind. To prevent unpredictable dangers in the real world, you decide to accept Audrey's commission and head to the center of the storm—the volcano where the giant dragon circles—to investigate and clear the source of the corruption.",
